	(property "Design notes" "FR aluminum electrolytic, 100 uF +/-20%, 16 V. D5 x H11 mm, lead spacing 2 mm, lead diameter 0.5 mm. Impedance maximum 0.300 ohm at 100 kHz and 20 C. On the negative rail the positive terminal connects to MID. Place LDO output capacitor directly beside U201. Module load remains below its 1680 uF capacitive-load rating."
